.TH BINGUX-TAXONOMY 1 "2026-10-28" "Bingux 0.1.0" "Bingux"
.SH NAME
bingux-taxonomy \- every Bingux UI component, icon and token, running
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bingux-taxonomy
.RI [ LOCATION ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bingux-taxonomy
is a development tool for people who build Bingux applications.
It opens a window that shows every component, icon and design token of the
Bingux UI library, live, grouped as foundations, icons, controls, containers and
files.
.PP
.I LOCATION
is a URI such as
.BR bingux\-taxonomy://controls/buttons ,
which opens that page.
The desktop entry offers the same pages as actions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bingux\-settings (1)
.PP
Documentation: docs/bingux-ui.md in the Bingux source.
